            }
          ],
          "text": "According to MR. EDGE, the respondent argues that the Sixth Amendment violation at issue is a core enumerated trial right, making it a distinct matter from other cases."
        },
        {
          "attribution": "MR. EDGE",
          "citations": [
            {
              "document_hash": "b094e89ff63a3a9fc73115dc219cfdfe6097571ba864151d857ca2463d066afc",
